          "x": 0.11241,
          "y": 0.05029,
          "w": 0.23712,
          "h": 0.02565,
          "ru": "Котловина. Здесь и заброшенные линии продолжают работать.",
          "en": "Resonance Basin. Even abandoned lines still work here."
        },
        {
          "textKey": "comic.spherist.resonance_basin.stabilization.before.p01.panel2",
          "type": "thought",
          "x": 0.06983,
          "y": 0.37991,
          "w": 0.28235,
          "h": 0.03187,
          "ru": "Крепление незнакомое. А расстояние между контактами… почти то же.",
          "en": "The fitting is unfamiliar. But the spacing between contacts... almost matches."
        },
        {
          "textKey": "comic.spherist.resonance_basin.stabilization.before.p01.panel3",
          "type": "thought",
          "x": 0.1504,
          "y": 0.70434,
          "w": 0.27595,
          "h": 0.02508,
          "ru": "Не могло же оно ждать именно меня.",
          "en": "Surely it wasn't waiting for me specifically."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
